WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.366 --> 00:00:02.700
Kay! Mm, mm, mm!

2
00:00:02.766 --> 00:00:05.433
- How do you like it, Inkay?
- Inkay.

3
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.033
No one's gonna take it from you, slow down.

4
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.066
I believe that's your favourite food, isn't it?

5
00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:12.166
Inkay! Ink!

6
00:00:12.233 --> 00:00:13.500
Hm?

7
00:00:13.566 --> 00:00:15.366
Here comes the twerp troop.

8
00:00:15.433 --> 00:00:18.000
Time to put in a dishonest day's work.

9
00:00:18.066 --> 00:00:19.866
Wobbuffet!

10
00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:24.600
A UFO? I know what that means.

11
00:00:24.666 --> 00:00:26.633
It's a spaceship aliens ride in.

12
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:30.366
Guess what? You can see real ones on the mountain just up ahead.

13
00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:33.666
While it's true there have been many alleged UFO sightings

14
00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:35.866
that have occurred at the peak of Grace Tower,

15
00:00:35.933 --> 00:00:38.233
those sightings proved to be something different.

16
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.366
There's no scientific evidence to back it up.

17
00:00:40.433 --> 00:00:43.966
Well, I think those aliens are real. I do.

18
00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:47.200
And maybe they have lots of cute Pokémon with them, you know?

19
00:00:47.266 --> 00:00:48.100
Denne-ne!

20
00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:50.500
I'd like to meet a Pokémon from space.

21
00:00:50.566 --> 00:00:52.333
- That'd be cool.
- Pika.

22
00:00:56.933 --> 00:00:57.933
Malamar.

23
00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.833
-It's a Malamar!

24
00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:01.000
Pika!

25
00:01:01.066 --> 00:01:02.866
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

26
00:01:02.933 --> 00:01:04.633
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

27
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:08.066
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

28
00:01:08.133 --> 00:01:09.533
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

29
00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:13.366
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

30
00:01:13.433 --> 00:01:16.633
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

31
00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:19.500
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

32
00:01:19.566 --> 00:01:24.033
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

33
00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:28.733
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

34
00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:31.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

35
00:01:33.866 --> 00:01:36.966
Facing the Grand Design!

36
00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.366
On their journey to Coumarine City,

37
00:01:42.433 --> 00:01:44.900
our heroes have suddenly come across a Malamar

38
00:01:44.966 --> 00:01:48.633
at the foot of a rocky mountain called Grace Tower.

39
00:01:48.700 --> 00:01:51.433
- Hey. That's a Malamar, right?
- It is!

40
00:01:51.500 --> 00:01:55.700
It looks like the one who hypnotised us that time.

41
00:01:58.033 --> 00:02:00.200
Careful. Watch out for the light.

42
00:02:02.366 --> 00:02:04.400
- Mal.
- Huh?

43
00:02:09.233 --> 00:02:12.700
-Inkay, Inkay, Inkay.

44
00:02:12.766 --> 00:02:15.766
Wow. Look at all the Malamar and Inkay.

45
00:02:15.833 --> 00:02:17.333
- Amazing.
- Ah.

46
00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:20.700
This forest must be home to lots of wild Malamar and Inkay.

47
00:02:20.766 --> 00:02:24.033
- And lots of Flabébé too.

48
00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.366
Look at the Bidoof.

49
00:02:29.333 --> 00:02:31.100
Ledyba!

50
00:02:31.166 --> 00:02:33.233
They're eating together.

51
00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:36.233
- Looks like they're all good friends.
- Ne, denne-ne!

52
00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:39.400
I guess all the Malamar who live here are really nice.

53
00:02:39.466 --> 00:02:40.466
Pika.

54
00:02:40.533 --> 00:02:43.600
Dig it. Those Malamar and Inkay look so happy.

55
00:02:43.666 --> 00:02:45.466
It's like a Pokémon paradise.

56
00:02:45.533 --> 00:02:47.066
Sure is nice.

57
00:02:47.133 --> 00:02:48.966
Inkay! Inkay! Inkay!

58
00:02:49.833 --> 00:02:51.233
- Look out!

59
00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:56.966
- What's wrong with them?
- Hey, what gives?

60
00:02:57.033 --> 00:02:59.800
You almost hit us, you know.

61
00:03:02.733 --> 00:03:04.733
- Inkay! Ink!
- Hm?

62
00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:08.000
- Hey. Inkay, wait!
- James?

63
00:03:08.066 --> 00:03:10.400
Man, what's with all the hectic hubbub?

64
00:03:10.466 --> 00:03:12.000
Wob!

65
00:03:12.066 --> 00:03:14.733
Someone needs to teach them how to drive.

66
00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:18.133
- For sure. That was not nice!
- Denne-ne-ne!

67
00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:20.366
Well, thank goodness everybody's all right.

68
00:03:20.433 --> 00:03:22.233
- Yeah, you're right.
- Pika, pika!

69
00:03:28.400 --> 00:03:30.933
Wow, what a strangely shaped mountain.

70
00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:34.000
That's why the UFOs are attracted to it.

71
00:03:34.066 --> 00:03:38.133
- Hey! Come out, UFO!
- Denne-ne!

72
00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:41.433
Hi, alien Pokémon! I wanna be your friend!

73
00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:43.266
Pika, pika!

74
00:03:43.333 --> 00:03:47.133
I already told you. UFOs and aliens aren't real.

75
00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:50.133
I know. Let's climb up and see for ourselves.

76
00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:55.433
Ugh! You actually wanna climb that thing?

77
00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:07.966
Inkay!

78
00:04:08.033 --> 00:04:11.433
Inkay, slow down.

79
00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:13.800
Inkay! Ink!

80
00:04:13.866 --> 00:04:16.300
I can't believe it's making us climb this monster.

81
00:04:16.366 --> 00:04:17.833
Wobba, Wobbuffet!

82
00:04:19.899 --> 00:04:21.733
-Wob, wobba.

83
00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:24.566
Huh? It's those trucks.

84
00:04:29.133 --> 00:04:30.333
-What's that?

85
00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:31.466
I'm seein' things.

86
00:04:40.466 --> 00:04:43.233
Would someone tell me what's going on?

87
00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:46.233
Hm. I feel like I've seen them before.

88
00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:47.333
-Inkay!

89
00:04:48.966 --> 00:04:51.066
It's a Malamar.

90
00:04:51.133 --> 00:04:56.433
Ugh! That's not just any Malamar. It's the one from the radio observatory.

91
00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:59.566
That's that wicked Malamar that had us by the brains.

92
00:04:59.633 --> 00:05:01.900
- and wouldn't let go!
- Wobba!

93
00:05:01.966 --> 00:05:04.966
Oh, no. Three of them.

94
00:05:05.033 --> 00:05:07.733
I bet they're not here for their favourite charity.

95
00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:08.900
Inkay, Inkay...

96
00:05:08.966 --> 00:05:12.900
Malamar, Malamar, Malamar...

97
00:05:12.966 --> 00:05:15.900
Inkay, Inkay, Inkay, Inkay, Inkay...

98
00:05:15.966 --> 00:05:17.466
Meowth, translation, please.

99
00:05:17.533 --> 00:05:20.300
I can't tell. It's over the top with rage.

100
00:05:20.366 --> 00:05:22.966
It better not be trying to hand us over to them.

101
00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:26.366
Although I wouldn't put it past that traitor.

102
00:05:26.433 --> 00:05:29.633
It must want us to be hypnotised, so we can be controlled again.

103
00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:31.500
- What? It can't be.
- Inkay, Inkay!

104
00:05:31.566 --> 00:05:34.100
Don't forget Inkay evolves into Malamar.

105
00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:36.666
I wouldn't be surprised if they're all in cahoots.

106
00:05:36.733 --> 00:05:38.200
Perish the thought.

107
00:05:38.266 --> 00:05:41.000
My Inkay would never do something so sinister.

108
00:05:41.066 --> 00:05:44.133
It despises those malicious Malamar like we do.

109
00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:46.433
Then why is it giving away our position?

110
00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:48.000
- Well, you see...
- Oh.

111
00:05:48.066 --> 00:05:49.333
Malamar.

112
00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:50.866
You and your big mouth.

113
00:05:50.933 --> 00:05:53.633
I think it's time to beat this pop stand. Agh!

114
00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:54.700
- You too.
- Inkay, Inkay!

115
00:05:54.766 --> 00:05:58.200
Malamar. Malamar.

116
00:05:58.266 --> 00:06:01.733
- You've gotta get a grip, big brother.
- Ah!

117
00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:03.633
Easy for you to say, little sister.

118
00:06:03.700 --> 00:06:06.033
All right, guys. Let's take a break.

119
00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:07.666
- Good idea.
- Pika!

120
00:06:16.566 --> 00:06:17.700
Team Rocket.

121
00:06:17.766 --> 00:06:19.933
Trying to steal Pikachu again, aren't you?

122
00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.733
Why don't you guys give it a rest?

123
00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:25.400
Please! It's not the time for stealing anyone or anything.

124
00:06:25.466 --> 00:06:29.266
Look, twerps, we've got big problems. You dopes have got big problems too.

125
00:06:29.333 --> 00:06:30.966
- What are you doing?
- Huh?

126
00:06:31.033 --> 00:06:32.766
Get in here.

127
00:06:34.066 --> 00:06:37.733
- Stop loitering and hurry up.
- What's going on?

128
00:06:38.833 --> 00:06:40.833
Malamar...

129
00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:42.433
Malamar...

130
00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:44.700
I'll explain this later, Ash.

131
00:06:44.766 --> 00:06:46.466
Hold on. How do you know my name?

132
00:06:46.533 --> 00:06:51.133
I know Team Rocket's your enemy, but for now, we need a truce.

133
00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.433
- Huh?
- I don't believe it.

134
00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:53.533
Officer Jenny.

135
00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:01.000
It's good to see you all again.

136
00:07:02.466 --> 00:07:05.700
So the Malamar from the radio observatory's on this mountain?

137
00:07:05.766 --> 00:07:06.900
Pika?

138
00:07:06.966 --> 00:07:09.166
- Yes, and with two other Malamar.
- Hm.

139
00:07:09.233 --> 00:07:12.400
After the terrifying incident at the radio observatory,

140
00:07:12.466 --> 00:07:14.400
I began a secret investigation.

141
00:07:14.466 --> 00:07:17.633
Malamar are highly intelligent. Look at this.

142
00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:21.700
They manipulated the Kalos region's most distinguished scientists

143
00:07:21.766 --> 00:07:24.666
into activating their device for use as a weapon.

144
00:07:24.733 --> 00:07:26.633
As a weapon?

145
00:07:28.233 --> 00:07:30.366
Like the one you saw at the observatory.

146
00:07:30.433 --> 00:07:34.533
The scientists' device is now at the top of this mountain.

147
00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:38.233
I wonder, what are they going to do with this device?

148
00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:41.466
Last time we saw that Malamar, it wanted to take over the world

149
00:07:41.533 --> 00:07:42.866
as part of some grand design.

150
00:07:42.933 --> 00:07:46.233
I still can't be certain what their objective is.

151
00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:49.233
What I do know is that they're definitely plotting something.

152
00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:50.366
And it's massive.

153
00:07:50.433 --> 00:07:54.133
- I don't get it, but I'm scared.
- Denne-ne.

154
00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:57.866
No need to be scared. I'll stop them, no matter what their plan may be.

155
00:07:57.933 --> 00:08:00.633
I will not let them have their way!

156
00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:05.466
Pika?

157
00:08:09.133 --> 00:08:11.566
-What's that light?

158
00:08:11.633 --> 00:08:13.400
Malamar!

159
00:08:13.466 --> 00:08:15.800
- Pika! Pika!
- It's the Malamar.

160
00:08:15.866 --> 00:08:17.300
Inkay! Inkay!

161
00:08:17.366 --> 00:08:22.200
- Inkay, settle down.
- Not again. Inkay did this before.

162
00:08:22.266 --> 00:08:24.266
Now I'm really getting suspicious.

163
00:08:24.333 --> 00:08:28.066
- Mar. Malamar.
- Huh?

164
00:08:28.133 --> 00:08:31.333
Yipes. They said, "So we meet again, intruders."

165
00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:32.666
Malamar.

166
00:08:32.733 --> 00:08:35.466
"The final stage of our grand design has begun."

167
00:08:35.533 --> 00:08:38.133
-Final stage of their grand design?

168
00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:41.900
What are you going to do with that ball of light? What are you up to?

169
00:08:41.966 --> 00:08:44.033
Malamar.

170
00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:52.200
- Huh?
- Pika?

171
00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:59.200
- Bonnie, Serena, Ash.
- Jessie, Wobbuffet. No!

172
00:08:59.266 --> 00:09:00.933
- Malamar.
- Uh!

173
00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.133
Inkay!

174
00:09:04.733 --> 00:09:07.200
Malamar!

175
00:09:07.266 --> 00:09:09.433
We need to get away for the time being.

176
00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.933
- He's right.
- Let's do what he says.

177
00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:16.166
- Now, Bunnelby, come out and use Dig.
- Bunnelby.

178
00:09:16.233 --> 00:09:17.766
Bunnelby, by, by, by, by...

179
00:09:17.833 --> 00:09:21.000
Don't worry. I swear I'll come back and get you out of this.

180
00:09:21.066 --> 00:09:23.066
OK. We're all counting on you.

181
00:09:23.133 --> 00:09:24.866
Come on, this way.

182
00:09:24.933 --> 00:09:28.300
Jessie and Wobbuffet, hang tough. We'll get you out of there.

183
00:09:28.366 --> 00:09:29.366
Let's go.

184
00:09:29.433 --> 00:09:31.266
Inkay! Inkay, Inkay!

185
00:09:31.333 --> 00:09:33.766
- Mala.
- Lamar.

186
00:09:33.833 --> 00:09:36.266
-Pika!

187
00:09:38.333 --> 00:09:41.033
Malamar.

188
00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:44.100
Who's that Pokémon?

189
00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.233
It's Bidoof.

190
00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:52.300
Bidoof!

191
00:09:58.166 --> 00:10:00.033
By, by, by, by, Bunnelby!

192
00:10:02.733 --> 00:10:04.533
Free at last.

193
00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:08.033
Thanks a lot, Bunnelby. Now get a good rest.

194
00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:10.166
Inkay! Inkay!

195
00:10:10.233 --> 00:10:13.000
Ugh! What's gotten into you? Dear.

196
00:10:13.066 --> 00:10:16.833
You're acting like you've completely lost your Inkay-ish mind. Why?

197
00:10:16.900 --> 00:10:19.533
Chill out. I can't understand what you're saying.

198
00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:22.533
Ink! Inkay, Inkay! Inkay!

199
00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:27.133
Inkay can't forgive that evil Malamar for controlling Team Rocket.

200
00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:31.533
No, for controlling you back then. Enough gettin' jerked around.

201
00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:34.200
Inkay's gonna knock their blocks off.

202
00:10:34.266 --> 00:10:36.533
- Oh, I see.
- Inkay!

203
00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:38.966
I didn't know you felt that way.

204
00:10:39.033 --> 00:10:41.766
I'm sorry I was so totally clueless about you, pal.

205
00:10:41.833 --> 00:10:44.700
Now, let's show those Malamar what for.

206
00:10:44.766 --> 00:10:45.966
Inkay!

207
00:10:46.033 --> 00:10:47.000
- Huh? Wait.
- Hm?

208
00:10:47.066 --> 00:10:49.266
Those Malamar are really strong.

209
00:10:49.333 --> 00:10:51.600
We don't stand a chance against them by ourselves.

210
00:10:51.666 --> 00:10:54.500
The twerp's right. So what're we gonna do?

211
00:10:54.566 --> 00:10:56.366
Ink! Inkay!

212
00:10:56.433 --> 00:10:58.533
Hey, where are you going?

213
00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:00.866
Wait! I'll bet it has an idea.

214
00:11:00.933 --> 00:11:03.666
I believe in Inkay. Come on, let's go.

215
00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:11.166
Malamar! Malamar.

216
00:11:11.233 --> 00:11:12.633
Malamar!

217
00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:14.900
All right. What's your plan?

218
00:11:14.966 --> 00:11:17.300
Malamar.

219
00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:23.133
What's going on?

220
00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:26.300
I see. So this is your grand design.

221
00:11:26.366 --> 00:11:28.833
You want to use that light to alter our world.

222
00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:31.633
To change the environment to suit you.

223
00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:34.833
And that's what it will look like when you're all done.

224
00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:36.633
That's how the world's gonna end up?

225
00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:39.133
- No. No. I don't want that!
- Denne-ne-ne-ne!

226
00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:41.633
Malamar!

227
00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:54.000
- Mal?
- Inkay! Ink!

228
00:11:54.066 --> 00:11:57.966
Wait. Don't attack. We're the good guys. We're on your side.

229
00:11:58.033 --> 00:11:59.966
Ink! Inkay, Inkay!

230
00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:04.533
I see. Inkay's asking the forest Malamar to help us.

231
00:12:04.600 --> 00:12:07.733
So Inkay's brilliant idea is to pit the good Malamar

232
00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:09.466
against the evil Malamar.

233
00:12:09.533 --> 00:12:11.300
So how are they taking it?

234
00:12:11.366 --> 00:12:13.266
I think the jury's still out.

235
00:12:13.333 --> 00:12:16.766
See, they're kind of not buyin' the bad Malamar's plot.

236
00:12:16.833 --> 00:12:18.900
Inkay! Inkay, Inkay!

237
00:12:20.333 --> 00:12:21.933
Malamar.

238
00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.766
It must have followed us all the way here.

239
00:12:23.833 --> 00:12:26.166
Malamar!

240
00:12:27.133 --> 00:12:29.433
It... it used Hyper Beam.

241
00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:32.566
Ma! Malamar! Malamar.

242
00:12:32.633 --> 00:12:35.066
Meowth, translation.

243
00:12:35.133 --> 00:12:39.133
"Attention. Join our mission, all my fellow Pokémon.

244
00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:42.933
"Those who refuse will be eliminated." And that's that.

245
00:12:44.133 --> 00:12:46.200
Malamar.

246
00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:50.600
- Mala.
- Malamar.

247
00:12:50.666 --> 00:12:54.533
That Malamar is really mad its buddies were attacked.

248
00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:57.700
- Malamar!
- Inkay!

249
00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.500
- Yeah! Huh?
- Uh...

250
00:13:07.466 --> 00:13:12.066
- Uh! Thank you. I'm truly grateful.
- Mala.

251
00:13:12.133 --> 00:13:16.866
So what do you say? Join us in our mission to stop those evildoers once and for all.

252
00:13:16.933 --> 00:13:18.400
- Won't you please?
- Inkay.

253
00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.166
-That one turned red.

254
00:13:31.233 --> 00:13:32.900
Aah! That one too.

255
00:13:32.966 --> 00:13:34.300
- It's all starting.
- Huh?

256
00:13:34.366 --> 00:13:36.600
- This is their countdown.
- Their countdown?

257
00:13:36.666 --> 00:13:39.800
All the gathered energy will most likely be released now.

258
00:13:39.866 --> 00:13:41.133
- Whoa, no way.
- Pika.

259
00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:44.866
Come on! James and Meowth should have been back here by now.

260
00:13:44.933 --> 00:13:46.133
Wobbuffet!

261
00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.566
- Malamar.
- Malamar?

262
00:13:53.366 --> 00:13:56.033
Malamar!

263
00:13:59.266 --> 00:14:01.466
- Everybody.
- Huh?

264
00:14:05.166 --> 00:14:06.900
Uh! Better late than never.

265
00:14:06.966 --> 00:14:09.300
- You're in good hands.
- Inkay.

266
00:14:09.366 --> 00:14:10.500
Are you all right?

267
00:14:10.566 --> 00:14:12.500
- Clemont.
- Big brother.

268
00:14:12.566 --> 00:14:16.100
- You could've moved it a little quicker.
- Wobbuffet.

269
00:14:16.166 --> 00:14:19.400
Sorry about that. It took a bit of doing to procure some help.

270
00:14:19.466 --> 00:14:20.900
Inkay!

271
00:14:20.966 --> 00:14:22.866
Heh. Huh? Inkay.

272
00:14:22.933 --> 00:14:25.166
- Inkay, Inkay!
- Malamar!

273
00:14:25.233 --> 00:14:27.100
-Inkay, Inkay! Inkay, Inkay!

274
00:14:27.166 --> 00:14:29.633
Kay, Inkay, Inkay, ink! Inkay, Inkay, Inkay!

275
00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:31.100
Ma...

276
00:14:31.166 --> 00:14:33.133
That jerk's hypnotising Inkay.

277
00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:36.233
It's forcing Inkay to join up with them against its will.

278
00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:38.166
Wait, isn't Inkay already on their side?

279
00:14:38.233 --> 00:14:39.233
- Huh?
- Wobba.

280
00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:40.566
- Never!
- Huh?

281
00:14:40.633 --> 00:14:43.766
Inkay and I are true partners. Friends to the end.

282
00:14:43.833 --> 00:14:46.566
James is right. Inkay was freakin' out on us before

283
00:14:46.633 --> 00:14:50.266
because it was tryin' to protect James from those dopes all along.

284
00:14:54.366 --> 00:14:56.233
Inkay...

285
00:14:57.500 --> 00:14:59.400
Why would you do something like that?

286
00:14:59.466 --> 00:15:02.166
Inkay! Kay!

287
00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:09.100
Please, stop it, old chum.

288
00:15:09.166 --> 00:15:12.466
Are you going to let our bond be severed by that creep?

289
00:15:12.533 --> 00:15:15.333
Ah! Wait a sec.

290
00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:17.733
Look at this. It's your favourite.

291
00:15:17.800 --> 00:15:20.766
A croissant. Our friendship began with this.

292
00:15:20.833 --> 00:15:23.733
You've got to remember and come back to me.

293
00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:25.966
Malamar.

294
00:15:26.033 --> 00:15:27.866
Inkay, Ink.

295
00:15:27.933 --> 00:15:30.466
Inkay!

296
00:15:30.533 --> 00:15:32.366
Oof!

297
00:15:36.266 --> 00:15:38.866
Let this remind you. We're partners.

298
00:15:38.933 --> 00:15:40.300
- Ink.
- Remember our days together.

299
00:15:40.366 --> 00:15:41.366
Ink, ink, ink, ink.

300
00:15:58.833 --> 00:16:02.766
Ink, ink, ink, ink. Ink, ink, ink, ink.

301
00:16:02.833 --> 00:16:04.433
- Inkay!
- Are you back?

302
00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.400
- Do you remember me?
- Ink, ink, ink, ink!

303
00:16:06.466 --> 00:16:09.266
- Inkay! Ink!
- Aaah!

304
00:16:09.333 --> 00:16:10.533
- Ah!
- Yes!

305
00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:13.033
Mal?

306
00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:15.700
OK, Inkay. It's payback time.

307
00:16:15.766 --> 00:16:18.233
So use Tackle. Seal the deal.

308
00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:20.800
- Inkay!
- Mala!

309
00:16:22.866 --> 00:16:25.266
- Nice shot, chum.
- Inkay.

310
00:16:25.333 --> 00:16:28.266
- Malamar.
- Malamar.

311
00:16:28.333 --> 00:16:30.366
- Let's get in there too, Pikachu.
- Pika!

312
00:16:30.433 --> 00:16:34.233
Yeah. We'll make sure this is as far as they go.

313
00:16:36.166 --> 00:16:38.066
Malamar!

314
00:16:38.133 --> 00:16:40.566
- Pikachu, now. Thunderbolt.
- Pika!

315
00:16:40.633 --> 00:16:43.266
Pikachu!

316
00:16:43.333 --> 00:16:45.033
Malamar!

317
00:16:48.133 --> 00:16:50.000
Mala!

318
00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:54.233
Manectric, use Thunder. Go!

319
00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:03.233
Manectric!

320
00:17:13.633 --> 00:17:16.300
- Look. The light's disappearing.
- That's awesome.

321
00:17:16.366 --> 00:17:19.599
- Pika!
- Yay! Yay!

322
00:17:30.133 --> 00:17:32.533
It's over. Your plan has failed.

323
00:17:32.600 --> 00:17:35.433
Now, come with me quietly, if you know what's good for you.

324
00:17:35.500 --> 00:17:38.433
Ma! Malamar, mar, mar!

325
00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:42.300
They're escapin' into the future, but they'll be back to fight again.

326
00:17:42.366 --> 00:17:45.900
And when they return, their grand design will finally succeed.

327
00:17:57.500 --> 00:17:59.600
Mal!

328
00:17:59.666 --> 00:18:03.000
- Malamar!
- Mala!

329
00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:08.166
-Clemont, what are they doing?

330
00:18:08.233 --> 00:18:12.433
- They're destroying every bit of evidence.
- Guys! Everybody, run!

331
00:18:14.066 --> 00:18:16.366
Mala. Malamar.

332
00:18:24.800 --> 00:18:28.766
A plot to alter our world. Just thinking about it gives me the creeps.

333
00:18:28.833 --> 00:18:32.200
I know. But for now, I'm glad we stopped them.

334
00:18:32.266 --> 00:18:34.766
- Pika.
- Ah. Look!

335
00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:41.666
They said they're heading into the future, but that's not all they said.

336
00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:45.700
They said they might come back someday.

337
00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:53.366
And so, Malamar's terrifying plot to change the world was stopped,

338
00:18:53.433 --> 00:18:55.133
and not a moment too soon.

339
00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:59.100
Now, our heroes will carry forward their search for new adventures

340
00:18:59.166 --> 00:19:01.800
and new Pokémon.

341
00:19:04.666 --> 00:19:07.066
Another plan to steal Pikachu bites the dust,

342
00:19:07.133 --> 00:19:10.833
thanks to the idiotic plot of those maniacal Malamar.

343
00:19:10.900 --> 00:19:12.633
Wobbuffet.

344
00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:13.566
Huh?

345
00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:17.300
Well, there's a happy group.

346
00:19:17.366 --> 00:19:19.533
I guess all's well that ends well.

347
00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:21.100
- Inkay!
- Malamar.

348
00:19:21.166 --> 00:19:23.300
- Hm?
- Malamar.

349
00:19:23.366 --> 00:19:26.666
- Inkay?
- They're all sayin' Inkay's their buddy.

350
00:19:26.733 --> 00:19:28.733
- Inkay, Inkay.
- Hm?

351
00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:31.166
Inkay, Inkay.

352
00:19:36.566 --> 00:19:39.600
Inkay, Inkay.

353
00:19:39.666 --> 00:19:41.866
Hah. They really like Inkay,

354
00:19:41.933 --> 00:19:45.700
and Inkay seems to like them too, don't you think?

355
00:19:45.766 --> 00:19:48.633
- Let's go.
- Hold on.

356
00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:51.033
- James?
- Inkay? Inkay!

357
00:19:51.100 --> 00:19:53.033
Inkay, Ink!

358
00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:56.733
Your happiness is more important to me than anything in the world,

359
00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:59.033
and that includes asking you to stay with me.

360
00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:00.533
Hm! Inkay, Inkay-kay!

361
00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:02.166
"That's why I'm stayin' with you.

362
00:20:02.233 --> 00:20:06.033
Bein' with you and the rest of Team Rocket makes me happy,

363
00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:08.500
so of course I'm coming along with you."

364
00:20:08.566 --> 00:20:10.800
Inkay, Inkay, Inkay...

365
00:20:10.866 --> 00:20:14.400
- Oh, Inkay. You're so...
- Ink?

366
00:20:14.466 --> 00:20:19.300
Please forgive me for doubting the lasting bond between us.

367
00:20:19.366 --> 00:20:21.200
- Inkay, old chum.
- Aw!

368
00:20:21.266 --> 00:20:26.733
That's what bein' a team is all about. It's all for one.

369
00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:28.866
Wobbuffet.

370
00:20:28.933 --> 00:20:31.733
What can I say? You two are a perfect pair.

371
00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:33.866
Inkay!

372
00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:42.133
All right. We'll get Pikachu next time. What do you say, team?.

373
00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:47.066
And the journey continues.
